      "instance_name": "smug_dog_meme_tropes",
      "label": "Smug Dog Meme Tropes",
      "description": "The visual of a dog with a smug or condescending expression is often used in internet memes to convey arrogance, menace, or superiority. This trope is frequently employed to amplify the hostile or predatory tone of the accompanying text, making the message more impactful and emotionally charged. The dog's expression is not inherently hateful but is culturally coded to imply menace when paired with hateful text.",
