      "description": "A broad social and political phenomenon involving prejudice, bias, and systemic oppression against individuals based on their sexual orientation or gender identity. This includes harmful stereotypes, hate speech, and discriminatory policies. The meme explicitly references this category by using derogatory language ('trans hunting') to target a specific group within this community.",
