      "label": "The smug dog is mapped as the 'hunter' in the trans hunting metaphor",
      "description": "The textual phrase 'i'm going trans hunting' is mapped onto the visual entity of the smug dog. The dog's menacing and condescending expression is culturally coded to represent predatory intent, which aligns with the hateful metaphor of 'trans hunting'. The dog becomes the visual embodiment of the 'hunter' described in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the dog's demeanor is projected as the literal or symbolic agent of the hateful action described in the text.",
