      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the smug dog as the 'hunter'",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the smug dog, which is culturally coded to represent predatory intent. The dog's menacing expression is mapped as the literal embodiment of the 'hunter' in the text 'i'm going trans hunting', creating an analogical projection where the user identifies with or imagines themselves as the hunter. This projection is implicit, not explicit, but is reinforced by the meme's structure where the visual and textual elements are fused to create a hostile persona.",
